        "desc": "packages/main/src/core/store.ts:486-499 overwrites a matching findings.json row with the original append-only ledger finding payload whenever recordId matches. finding_resolve only updates findings.json at handlers/finding.ts:821-843 and appends no ledger status mutation. At HEAD 591642d, commits e93c480 and 591642d are finding_resolve metadata commits, yet proof-or-stop finding_list --storyId=B-fe8f --json still returns F-001 and F-002 status=open. Thus resolution/dismissal is reverted on read, making user output and lifecycle consumers observe stale open state and invalidating exactly-once historical correction. Add append-only status-transition records/current projection plus a regression that resolves and rereads a ledger-backed Finding.",
